OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over attacking police
OL,4,Aofficer during Glasgow protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested and charged for
OL,7,Fattacking a police officer during an
OL,8,Fanti-immigration march on Wednesday
OL,9,Fthat affected several Glasgow streets.
OL,11,FSocial media footage showed dozens of
OL,12,Fpeople, many wearing masks or dark
OL,13,Fclothing, walking through the east end
OL,14,Fof the city and chanting "send them
OL,15,Fhome" and "our streets".
OL,17,FA 32-year-old man has now been charged
OL,18,Fwith assaulting a police officer during
OL,19,Fthe protest at Westmuir Street.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
